OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,FOlympic gymnastics champion Rhys
OL,8,FMcClenaghan dismissed the Commonwealth
OL,9,FGames as a "training day" after
OL,10,Ffailing to win a medal in the men's
OL,11,Fpommel final at the Glasgow
OL,12,FInternational Centre.
OL,14,FThe 27-year-old scored 13.0 points to
OL,15,Ffinish in sixth place, well below gold
OL,16,Fmedallist Jordan Carroll of Canada,
OL,17,Fwith two Scots ` all-around champion
OL,18,FReuben Ward and his team-mate Cameron
OL,19,FLynn ` taking silver and bronze
OL,20,Frespectively.
OL,26,@qD@LOUqD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,414,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,FMcClenaghan shrugged off the loss,
OL,8,Fwhich he blamed on a minor error on a
OL,9,Fnew mount at the start of his routine,
OL,10,Fand said he would immediately shift
OL,11,Ffocus to the upcoming European and
OL,12,Fworld championships.
OL,14,F"This is a training day for me, so we
OL,15,Fgo back to the gym as soon as I can,
OL,16,Fand we tackle it just like we tackle
OL,17,Fany training day," said McClenaghan, a
OL,18,Fdouble world champion who claimed gold
OL,19,Fat the Paris 2024 Olympics after
OL,20,Ffalling in the final in Tokyo.
OL,26,@vD@AOUyD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,414,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,F"Even if I had won gold here it still
OL,8,Fwould have been treated as a stepping-
OL,9,Fstone. We go back to the gym as soon
OL,10,Fas we can, and we tackle it just like
OL,11,Fwe tackle any training day. We've got
OL,12,Four eye on the prize for the
OL,13,FEuropeans."
OL,15,FWard, who had qualified for the final
OL,16,Fin first place, held his nerve to take
OL,17,Fsilver but seemed more delighted to be
OL,18,Fable to share the podium experience
OL,19,Fwith Lynn, who had not been expected
OL,20,Fto trouble the top three.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
