PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,F"Scotland is a force to be reckoned
OL,8,Fwith in gymnastics and we are starting
OL,9,Fto prove that," said Ward, who claimed
OL,10,FScotland's first all-around title on
OL,11,FFriday. "I began it the other day and
OL,12,Fwe are snowballing now."
OL,14,FLuke Whitehouse made up for the
OL,15,Fdisappointing performance in the men's
OL,16,Fall-around competition by taking gold
OL,17,Fin the men's floor final.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@OO]sD@IOUtD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
