OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,414,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,FWhitehouse, a silver medallist and
OL,8,Fthree-time European champion on the
OL,9,Fapparatus, fell during his routine on
OL,10,FSunday but rebounded to score 14.566
OL,11,Fand take gold ahead of Canada's Rene
OL,12,FCournoyer and James Hardy of Australia.
OL,14,FThe Halifax 24-year-old admitted he
OL,15,Fhad been distracted since team-mate
OL,16,FGabriel Langton crashed off the high
OL,17,Fbar midway through the team final on
OL,18,FFriday, requiring an overnight stay in
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
