PN,41306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F413A1786454337
OL,3,CRhys McClenaghan looks forward and
OL,4,Csays Commonwealth Games are a
OL,5,C'training day'
OL,7,FWhitehouse said: "There's been a lot
OL,8,Fgoing on. You've just got to try and
OL,9,Fignore the noise and focus on your
OL,10,Froutines. Gabriel's my room-mate here
OL,11,Fand to know that he's fine and doing
OL,12,Fwell, I couldn't be happier."
OL,14,FTwin sisters Abigail and Emily Roper
OL,15,Ftook a pair of bronze medals in the
OL,16,Fwomen's vault and uneven bars finals
OL,17,Frespectively. England's Abigail Martin
OL,18,Fwon silver in the vault behind winner
OL,19,FLia-Monica Fontaine of Canada.
